msgstr "Project-Id-Version: Nexus source documentation\nLanguage: zh_CN\nMIME-Version: 1.0\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\nX-Nexus-Reviewed: true\nX-Nexus-Source-SHA256: 4e6814ffe1ee1adb201c8205b19a74ad5162687ac4c55a8d9b4db7019f322d6e\n"

msgid "U575 finite SRAM4 copy across Stop2"
msgstr "U575 跨 Stop2 的有限 SRAM4 复制"

msgid "This page describes the implemented STM32U575ZIT6Q TZEN0 baremetal finite-copy contract. Focused software models, independent source review, a selected public Cortex-M33 reset-image link and one relocated installed development-SDK consumer have passed. The complete clean v7 verification plan, current CI/offline qualification and physical validation remain separate; these development checks establish no physical result. The complete {download}`IO-32 <io-evolution-execution.csv>` and {download}`SOC-35 <soc-refinement-execution.csv>` exits remain open; physical HIL is `not_executed`."
msgstr "本文描述已实现的 STM32U575ZIT6Q TZEN0 裸机有限复制合同。有针对性的软件模型、独立源码审查、一个选定公共 Cortex-M33 复位镜像链接及一个搬移安装版开发 SDK consumer 已通过。完整 clean v7 验证计划、当前 CI／离线资格及物理验证仍属独立范围；这些开发检查不建立物理结果。完整的 {download}`IO-32 <io-evolution-execution.csv>` 与 {download}`SOC-35 <soc-refinement-execution.csv>` 退出仍开放；物理 HIL 为 `not_executed`。"

msgid "The optional `Nexus::U575LpdmaCopy` receiver uses only LPDMA1 channel 0 and the 16 KiB nonsecure SRAM4 window at `0x28000000..0x28003fff`. The same concrete `Nexus::U575Stop2Copy` owner controls RTC AlarmA, WUT and the full sleep/recovery sequence. The WUT-only `Nexus::U575Stop2` is an alternative target; selecting both is rejected by CMake. This is a finite memory-to-memory copy, with no peripheral route, general LPBAM plan, RTOS worker, queue or generated factory."
msgstr "可选的 `Nexus::U575LpdmaCopy` receiver 只使用 LPDMA1 通道 0 和 `0x28000000..0x28003fff` 的 16 KiB 非安全 SRAM4 窗口。同一具体 `Nexus::U575Stop2Copy` owner 控制 RTC AlarmA、WUT 及完整睡眠／恢复顺序。仅 WUT 的 `Nexus::U575Stop2` 是另一可选 target；同时选择两者会被 CMake 拒绝。这是有限的存储器到存储器复制，不提供外设路由、通用 LPBAM 计划、RTOS worker、队列或生成的 factory。"

msgid "![FIG-27: current selected SRAM4 copy and compound Stop2 release; labeled arrows distinguish private calls, hardware triggers and final-access proofs; selected ARM and installed-SDK development checks passed; full qualification and physical validation remain open](../assets/diagrams/u575-stop2-copy.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-27：当前选定 SRAM4 复制与 Stop2 复合释放；箭头标签区分私有调用、硬件触发与最终访问证明；选定 ARM 和安装版 SDK 开发检查已通过，完整资格与物理验证仍开放](../assets/diagrams/u575-stop2-copy.svg)"

msgid "FIG-27: current selected SRAM4 copy and compound Stop2 release; labeled arrows distinguish private calls, hardware triggers and final-access proofs; selected ARM and installed-SDK development checks passed; full qualification and physical validation remain open"
msgstr "FIG-27：当前选定 SRAM4 复制与 Stop2 复合释放；箭头标签区分私有调用、硬件触发与最终访问证明；选定 ARM 和安装版 SDK 开发检查已通过，完整资格与物理验证仍开放"

msgid "FIG-27 is separate from the WUT-only FIG-24. Solid arrows name calls, hardware events or ordered cleanup; dashed arrows name external premises or open physical exits. An idle DMA channel alone cannot release this compound loan."
msgstr "FIG-27 与仅使用 WUT 的 FIG-24 分开。实线箭头标明调用、硬件事件或有序清理；虚线箭头标明外部前提或尚未完成的物理退出。仅 DMA 通道 idle 不能释放该复合借用。"

msgid "Prepare the exact memory and clock owners"
msgstr "准备精确的存储与时钟 owner"

msgid "The maintained [assembly](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/assemblies/u575-lpdma-copy-stop2.toml) selects SRAM4 explicitly. Link only `Nexus::U575Stop2Copy` for this mode; it brings the copy and retained-time dependencies. Its reset-only startup must begin with the DMA gates off, verify the existing Range4 supply and SRAM4 power/retention state, enable SRAM4, initialize its DATA/BSS, then enable and read back LPDMA1EN. It preserves NOINIT bytes; their presence proves neither valid data nor a constructed descriptor. Runtime owners must not rescue lost SRAM4 by changing its power-down fields."
msgstr "维护的[装配](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/assemblies/u575-lpdma-copy-stop2.toml) 显式选择 SRAM4。此模式只链接 `Nexus::U575Stop2Copy`；它带入 copy 与 retained-time 依赖。其仅复位启动必须从 DMA 门控关闭状态开始，核对既有 Range4 供电及 SRAM4 供电／保留状态，启用 SRAM4，初始化其 DATA/BSS，然后启用并读回 LPDMA1EN。启动保留 NOINIT 字节；这些字节的存在既不证明数据有效，也不证明描述符已构造。运行态 owner 不得通过改变掉电字段来补救已经丢失的 SRAM4。"

msgid "At runtime, the external gate owner keeps SRAM4EN and LPDMA1EN enabled and the hardware configuration stable through stop and all joins. All four LPDMA channels and vectors must initially be quiet; no other channel may start. The selected profile requires TZEN0, unswapped Flash, effective MSIS4 and MSIK4, equal buses, true Range4 (`VOS=00`, `VOSRDY=1`, `BOOSTEN=0`) and caches off. The existing [Stop2 contract](u575-retained-time.md#select-and-use-the-stop2-owner) supplies the remaining masked-MSP, stopped-RUN, SRAM-retention and external exclusions."
msgstr "运行时，外部门控 owner 必须保持 SRAM4EN 与 LPDMA1EN 启用，并在 stop 及全部退出期间保持硬件配置稳定。初始四个 LPDMA 通道和向量都必须安静；不得启动其他通道。选定配置要求 TZEN0、未交换 Flash、有效 MSIS4 和 MSIK4、等分总线、真实 Range4（`VOS=00`、`VOSRDY=1`、`BOOSTEN=0`）及 cache 关闭。既有 [Stop2 合同](u575-retained-time.md#select-and-use-the-stop2-owner) 规定其余屏蔽中断的 MSP、RUN 已停止、SRAM 保留与外部排除条件。"

msgid "Source, destination and the whole 24 B, four-byte-aligned generated LLI workspace must be disjoint spans inside that exact SRAM4 window. CPU owner storage and the request may remain in retained SRAM1, but all control storage must be separate from the borrowed spans. Both blocks use incrementing byte transfers; length is at least 2 B and every extent must fit the window. The provider generates all six LLI words; callers supply no raw DMA instructions."
msgstr "源、目标及完整的 24 B、四字节对齐生成 LLI workspace 必须在该精确 SRAM4 窗口内互不重叠。CPU owner 存储和 request 可留在保留的 SRAM1，但所有控制存储必须与借用范围分离。两块都使用地址递增的字节传输；长度至少为 2 B，且每个范围必须完整落在窗口内。provider 生成全部六个 LLI word；调用方不提供原始 DMA 指令。"

#: docs/design/u575-stop2-copy.md:59
msgid ""
"Use the [retained-time API](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/soc/stm32/stm32u575_retained_time/include/nexus/components/stm32u575_retained_time.h),"
" [copy API](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/soc/stm32/stm32u575_lpdma_copy/include/nexus/components/stm32u575_lpdma_copy.h)"
" and [Stop2 copy API](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/soc/stm32/stm32u575_stop2/include/nexus/components/stm32u575_stop2_copy.h)"
" as the declaration authority. One privileged Thread serializes lifecycle "
"and control calls; no ISR or concurrent producer uses these objects. Copied "
"faces retain the same owner identity and require their own external observer"
" joins."
msgstr ""
"声明以[保留时间 API](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/soc/stm32/stm32u575_retained_time/include/nexus/components/stm32u575_retained_time.h)、[复制"
" API](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/soc/stm32/stm32u575_lpdma_copy/include/nexus/components/stm32u575_lpdma_copy.h)"
" 和 [Stop2 复制 API](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/soc/stm32/stm32u575_stop2/include/nexus/components/stm32u575_stop2_copy.h)"
" 为权威。一个特权 Thread 串行调用生命周期与控制操作；ISR 或并发 producer 不使用这些对象。复制的 face 仍保留相同 owner"
" 身份，其外部 observer 也必须退出。"

msgid "Admit, trigger and recover one copy"
msgstr "准入、触发与恢复一次复制"

msgid "Initialize the retained clock with `nx_stm32u575_retained_time_initialize_alarm_a_copy` and `wake_owner=nx_stm32u575_stop2_identity()`. Initialize the Stop2 owner and `nx_stm32u575_lpdma_copy_initialize` with that same live clock and identity. Initial RTC AlarmA, WUT and IRQ state must be quiet. The ordinary read-only clock initializer does not authorize this AlarmA mode."
msgstr "使用 `nx_stm32u575_retained_time_initialize_alarm_a_copy` 和 `wake_owner=nx_stm32u575_stop2_identity()` 初始化保留时钟。以同一个有效时钟及身份初始化 Stop2 owner 与 `nx_stm32u575_lpdma_copy_initialize`。初始 RTC AlarmA、WUT 及 IRQ 状态必须安静。普通只读时钟初始化函数不授权该 AlarmA 模式。"

msgid "Initialize the request base, obtain a successful `nx_stm32u575_retained_time_sample`, then call `nx_stm32u575_lpdma_copy_request_prepare` with the separate snapshot, SRAM4 spans, workspace and an absolute deadline in this retained domain or NEVER. Preparation copies metadata without borrowing or touching the buffers or workspace. Rejection leaves request bytes unchanged. End old Core TIM2 deadlines before Platform stop; no deadline is converted between domains."
msgstr "初始化 request base，成功取得 `nx_stm32u575_retained_time_sample`，再向 `nx_stm32u575_lpdma_copy_request_prepare` 传入独立 snapshot、SRAM4 范围、workspace，以及该保留时间域内的绝对 deadline 或 NEVER。prepare 复制元数据，不借用或访问 buffer 和 workspace。拒绝保持 request 字节不变。Platform 停止前结束旧 Core TIM2 deadline；不在两个时间域之间转换 deadline。"

msgid "Enroll every RUN producer and observer in the exact Stop2 ClockDomain. Close admission, stop Platform/System, join actual producers, IRQ/DMA users and deadline consumers, then release their leases after real drain. Call `nx_stm32u575_stop2_copy_enter` with this closed, empty barrier, the concrete copy face, prepared request, `escape_ticks` in 4096..65536 RTC/16 ticks (nominal 2..32 s) and a positive per-phase `poll_limit`."
msgstr "将每个 RUN producer 和 observer 注册到精确的 Stop2 ClockDomain。关闭准入，停止 Platform/System，通过实际 API 退出 producer、IRQ/DMA 用户及 deadline consumer，并在真实排空后释放其 lease。向 `nx_stm32u575_stop2_copy_enter` 传入该关闭且为空的屏障、具体 copy face、已准备的 request、4096..65536 RTC/16 ticks 的 `escape_ticks`（标称 2..32 s），以及正的逐阶段 `poll_limit`。"

msgid "Keep privileged MSP Thread, CONTROL=0, PRIMASK=1 and BASEPRI=FAULTMASK=0 through entry and every retained recovery attempt. No scheduler may have started. The Stop2 owner privately validates readiness, arms the receiver and validates sleep before enabling the RTC producer. Rejection retains no new loan; `accepted=true` borrows the request, both buffers and workspace even if a later setup step fails."
msgstr "进入和每次保留恢复尝试期间都保持特权 MSP Thread、CONTROL=0、PRIMASK=1 和 BASEPRI=FAULTMASK=0。调度器不得已启动。Stop2 owner 私有地核对就绪、arm receiver 并核对睡眠条件，然后才启用 RTC producer。拒绝不保留新借用；`accepted=true` 借用 request、两个 buffer 及 workspace，即使后续设置步骤失败也不撤销。"

msgid "AlarmA uses all calendar mask bits, ALRMASSR=0, ALRAIE=0 and ALRAFCLR=0. Its next whole-second event drives rising trigger 14 for the first `floor(length/2)` bytes. The generated second LLI copies the remaining bytes without a trigger; TCEM selects completion of the last LLI and the final link is zero. The owner preserves ALRAF and DMA pending while the producer is enabled. Cleanup clears them only after producer withdrawal. WUT supplies an independent escape wake. Channel-0 IRQ114 or RTC IRQ2 may wake masked WFI without executing an interrupt handler. A pending wake may return immediately; `wait_executed` proves WFI ran, never physical Stop2 residency. WUT escape without an AlarmA event latches TIMEOUT and drains the finite receiver."
msgstr "AlarmA 使用全部日历 mask 位、ALRMASSR=0、ALRAIE=0 和 ALRAFCLR=0。下一个整秒事件以 trigger 14 上升沿触发首个 `floor(length/2)` 字节。生成的第二个 LLI 不经触发复制余下字节；TCEM 选择最后一个 LLI 完成，最终链接为零。producer 启用期间，owner 保留 ALRAF 和 DMA pending。清理只在撤回 producer 后清除它们。WUT 提供独立逃逸唤醒。通道 0 IRQ114 或 RTC IRQ2 可在中断屏蔽时唤醒 WFI，且不执行中断 handler。已有 pending 可使等待立即返回；`wait_executed` 只证明执行了 WFI，不证明物理 Stop2 驻留。没有 AlarmA 事件而发生 WUT 逃逸时锁存 TIMEOUT，并排空有限 receiver。"

msgid "The returned `accepted`, `dma_wake` and `transition` describe admission and the sleep boundary. They are not the final copy result. Read result and transferred count only after acquire-observing the request's SETTLED state. A deadline or `nx_stm32u575_lpdma_copy_cancel` requests withdrawal without revoking any borrow; late cancellation after observed DMA completion rejects STATE. Public `service` performs bounded DMA progress/drain and `stop` closes copy admission; neither can independently publish SETTLED."
msgstr "返回的 `accepted`、`dma_wake` 和 `transition` 描述准入与睡眠边界，不是最终复制结果。只有 acquire 观察到 request 的 SETTLED 状态后才能读取结果和传输计数。deadline 或 `nx_stm32u575_lpdma_copy_cancel` 请求撤回，不撤销任何借用；已观察到 DMA 完成后的迟到取消以 STATE 拒绝。公共 `service` 执行有界 DMA 推进／排空，`stop` 关闭复制准入；两者都不能独立发布 SETTLED。"

msgid "After wake or setup failure, verify the selected RUN access profile before any RTC or DMA MMIO. An unknown profile permits CPU deep-bit/vector withdrawal only and retains the compound loan and peripheral effects. Keep RUN admission closed and all storage alive until an external reviewed owner restores the required profile. `nx_stm32u575_stop2_recover` retries the same compound cleanup without another WFI. Observed external LPDMA1 reset during an active loan permanently quarantines the loan. Deasserting reset or observing quiet reset values cannot prove the prior master's final access; only an actual external system reset ends that responsibility."
msgstr "唤醒或设置失败后，在任何 RTC 或 DMA MMIO 前核对选定 RUN 访问配置。配置未知时只允许撤回 CPU deep 位／向量，并保留复合借用及外设效果。在外部已审 owner 恢复所需配置前，保持 RUN 准入关闭和全部存储有效。`nx_stm32u575_stop2_recover` 重试同一复合清理，不再次 WFI。活动借用期间观察到外部 LPDMA1 reset 会永久隔离该借用。撤销 reset 或观察到安静的 reset 值不能证明此前 master 的最终访问；只有实际外部系统 reset 才终止该责任。"

msgid "With a valid profile, withdraw and observe AlarmA/WUT producers before DMA drain. The receiver proves idle, using suspend/SUSPF when enabled, then writes the full-word channel RESET value and observes the complete CCR equal to zero before clearing channel address/link references, flags and NVIC pending state. Checking EN/SUSP alone cannot detect an ignored RESET write when the channel is already disabled; the full-word write also clears the ordinary interrupt-enable fields. It restores only its claimed channel-0 privilege and LPDMA/SRAM4 SMEN/AMEN bits, preserving RTC and unrelated bits; it owns no whole-controller reset or engine-enable gate. Only after all RTC, DMA, IRQ, power, gate and clock restoration is complete does Stop2 detach its face/request references and call the private final release. SETTLED is then the provider's final request access. Any failed proof retains the whole loan, including when the DMA itself is already idle. The retained copy marker remains live until final release succeeds, including when hardware effects are already zero; it rejects ordinary entry and another copy. Recovery retries final release too."
msgstr "配置有效时，先撤回并观察 AlarmA/WUT producer，再排空 DMA。receiver 证明 idle，启用中通过 suspend/SUSPF 取得该证明，然后写入完整 word 的通道 RESET 值，并在清除通道地址／链接引用、flag 和 NVIC pending 状态前观察到完整 CCR 等于零。通道已禁用时，仅检查 EN/SUSP 不能发现 RESET 写入被忽略；完整 word 写入也将普通 interrupt-enable 字段清零。它只恢复所占通道 0 privilege 和 LPDMA/SRAM4 SMEN/AMEN 位，保留 RTC 与无关位；它不拥有整控制器 reset 或 engine-enable 门控。全部 RTC、DMA、IRQ、供电、门控及 clock 恢复完成后，Stop2 才分离其 face/request 引用并调用私有最终 release。此时 SETTLED 是 provider 对 request 的最后一次访问。任一证明失败都保留整个借用，即使 DMA 本身已经 idle。保留的 copy marker 在最终 release 成功前一直有效，即使硬件效果已为零；它拒绝普通 enter 与另一次 copy。recover 也重试最终 release。"

msgid "Hardware isolation may finish with a tainted retained clock and publish an error; it cannot produce a fresh successful elapsed-time result. Join all clock users before explicit clock stop/reopen; a new generation invalidates every old binding and deadline. Reopen RUN admission and restart Platform only after no effects remain, creating a fresh Core TIM2 epoch. Retained samples resolve 3906.25 µs; WUT uses separate 2048 Hz ticks. `max_gap_seconds` must cover the full interval plus externally bounded arm, wake and drain latency. `poll_limit` bounds observations, not elapsed time; WFI has no CPU duration bound if hardware wake fails."
msgstr "硬件隔离可在保留时钟已 tainted 时完成并发布错误，但不能产生新的成功 elapsed-time 结果。显式停止／重开时钟前，退出全部时钟用户；新代次使每个旧绑定和 deadline 失效。仅在全部效果为零后重开 RUN 准入并重启 Platform，建立新的 Core TIM2 epoch。保留时钟采样分辨率为 3906.25 µs；WUT 使用独立的 2048 Hz tick。`max_gap_seconds` 必须覆盖整个间隔以及外部有界的 arm、唤醒和排空延迟。`poll_limit` 只限制观察次数，不限制耗时；硬件唤醒失败时，WFI 没有 CPU 时长上界。"

msgid "Scope and evidence"
msgstr "范围与证据"

#: docs/design/u575-stop2-copy.md:150
msgid ""
"The public headers and [copy implementation](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32u575/drivers/lpdma_copy.c) define the source contract;"
" the [private collaboration](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/soc/stm32/stm32u575_lpdma_copy/private/stm32u575_lpdma_copy_internal.h)"
" connects only the concrete Stop2 owner. Meaningful RED preceded the "
"production changes. Focused Native execution passed 30 receiver cases, 33 "
"retained-clock cases, 17 coupled cases using all three real C owners and "
"Core, and 30 WUT-only compatibility cases (21 unit plus 9 real-clock cases)."
" Independent source review is complete. Four direct-source Cortex-M33 images"
" passed development checks: the public copy reset image and three "
"default/retained/WUT omission images. One relocated, nonpublishable "
"installed-SDK consumer also compiled and linked against the reviewed source."
" The direct-source copy image uses 15,816 B Flash; the installed consumer "
"uses 15,840 B, with the 24 B difference from source-path strings and "
"alignment. Each reserves 2,384 B SRAM1 including the 2,048 B MSP, 64 B SRAM4"
" and no heap. The development receipts bind these checks to their exact "
"sources. This is not execution of the full clean v7 plan of 50 images or "
"current whole-candidate CI/offline qualification. No earlier software "
"candidate or physical result is inherited by this copy."
msgstr ""
"公共头文件及[复制实现](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32u575/drivers/lpdma_copy.c) "
"定义源码合同；[私有协作](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/soc/stm32/stm32u575_lpdma_copy/private/stm32u575_lpdma_copy_internal.h)"
" 只连接具体 Stop2 owner。生产变更前执行了有意义的 RED。有针对性的 Native 执行通过 receiver 30 项、保留时钟 33 "
"项、使用全部三个真实 C owner 及 Core 的耦合测试 17 项，以及仅 WUT 的兼容测试 30 项（21 项单元测试和 9 "
"项真实时钟测试）。独立源码审查已完成。四个直接源码 Cortex-M33 镜像通过开发检查：公共复制复位镜像，以及 "
"default／retained／WUT 三个省略验证镜像。一个搬移后的非可发布安装版 SDK consumer "
"也针对已审源码编译、链接通过。直接源码复制镜像使用 15,816 B Flash；安装版 consumer 使用 15,840 B，24 B "
"差异来自源码路径字符串和对齐。两者均保留 2,384 B SRAM1（含 2,048 B MSP）、64 B SRAM4，且没有 "
"heap。开发收据将这些检查绑定到精确源码。这不构成完整 clean v7 计划 50 个镜像或当前整个候选版本 "
"CI／离线资格的执行。本复制不继承先前软件候选或物理结果。"

msgid "This slice does not implement peripheral LPBAM, general autonomous scheduling, SRAM4-only operation, DVFS, RTOS Tick compensation, TrustZone sleep, Standby or VBAT continuity. Physical copy correctness, Stop2 residency, retention, current, oscillator accuracy and wake latency remain unexecuted. Software-model and ARM link results must bind their exact source; the original IO-32/SOC-35 exits remain open and unchanged."
msgstr "本纵切片不实现外设 LPBAM、通用自主调度、仅 SRAM4 运行、DVFS、RTOS Tick 补偿、TrustZone 睡眠、Standby 或 VBAT 连续性。物理复制正确性、Stop2 驻留、保留、电流、振荡器精度及唤醒延迟仍未执行。软件模型与 ARM 链接结果必须绑定精确源码；原始 IO-32/SOC-35 退出仍开放且保持不变。"
